  "content": {
    "id": "p31-q12-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "The graph shows the height in metres of a rollercoaster above the ground against the horizontal distance travelled, also in metres. The equation of this graph is in the form\n$$h(x)=\\frac{-x(x-a)(x-b)^2}{k}.$$",
